@startuml
!theme plain
title Despliegue en AWS Academy
node "Internet" as I
node "VPC por defecto · us-east-1" {
  node "Grupo de seguridad: solo TCP 80" as SG
  node "EC2 t3.medium (AL2023) · perfil myS3Role" as EC2 {
    artifact "backend :80" as B
    artifact "worker" as W
    artifact "modelo :8080 (interno)" as M
    artifact "rabbitmq :5672 (interno)" as R
  }
}
database "S3 todobarato-ep3-<cuenta>\nfuente.tgz · ep3.db" as S3
node "CloudWatch\nalarma CPU > 80 %" as CW
I --> SG
SG --> B
S3 --> EC2 : user-data (aws s3 cp)
EC2 ..> CW
note bottom of EC2
  SageMaker (plan A): create-model bloqueado por IAM\n(sin rol de ejecución). Plan B: mismo contrato\n/ping + /invocations en contenedor propio.
end note
@enduml
